vine 1.2.0
prefix: host
title: Target entrypoint and presentation-host adapter wiring
---
[root] Wire the target entrypoint and presentation-host ports (notstarted)
Files: host.vine; proposals/presentation-host.md; proposals/platform-support-matrix.md; crates/caravan-demo/**; tests/**
Do: Build the first target composition around independent translation, transport, storage, render-execution, and lifecycle/resource ports. The Orchestrator pulls those ports; the target entrypoint supplies their concrete adapters. Execute the in-memory proof first; native platform adapters, windowing, device resources, wgpu, and target-specific support rows remain later composition choices.
Accept: The host proposal names distinct adapter roles; the support matrix records independent axes and unselected target cells; an in-memory target composition can deliver abstract packets, submit owned render output, save/load encoded values, and compose with Stage/Orchestrator ownership; integration tests cover input permutations and failure boundaries; and all existing anchor/conformance evidence remains green.
-> host-contract
-> support-matrix
-> input-adapter
-> storage-adapter
-> render-adapter
-> host-composition
-> host-evidence
-> orchestrator
-> transport
-> rendering
